{
 "about": "The node's signed request_outcome (PROTOCOL-V3.md \u00a712.9, \u00a712.10) against what the client saw. rules: per reason, the most the node charges before body_released ('before') and after it ('after'); null: the node never names that reason then; zero / session_fee (if still due) / abandon_fee (max of the abandon fee and the session fee if still due) / reservation (the announced one); disclosed: only after the client disclosed the request's answer. Each case: requestOutcomeProblems(outcome, signed, ctx) is empty when ok, else one problem contains match. Shared by crypto/client, routstr-sdk and routstr-confidential-web (byte-identical copies).",
 "rules": {
  "request_received": {
   "before": null,
   "after": "reservation"
  },
  "settlement_failed": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": "reservation"
  },
  "settled_without_receipt": {
   "before": "abandon_fee",
   "after": "reservation",
   "disclosed": true
  },
  "unattested": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": "zero"
  },
  "provider_refused": {
   "before": "session_fee",
   "after": null
  },
  "provider_unreachable": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": null
  },
  "sidecar_failure": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": null
  },
  "evicted": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": null
  },
  "request_abandoned": {
   "before": "abandon_fee",
   "after": null
  },
  "not_started": {
   "before": "zero",
   "after": null
  }
 },
